  "description": "Enterprise-grade key management library with versioned encryption format (v2.3.0) and asymmetric key support (RSA, ECDSA). Features version-aware auto-decryption, automatic key rotation, multi-platform storage (Windows DPAPI, Linux AES-256-GCM, Azure Key Vault), distributed caching, health monitoring, and comprehensive audit logging. Fully tested with 117/117 tests passing (100% success rate).",
